Moodle LMS
  Copyright Moodle Pty Ltd and contributors
  License: GNU GPL v3.0 or later
  This git tree does not contain the Moodle source.
  The image build downloads a pinned tarball from packaging.moodle.org
  (see versions.lock). The tarball includes COPYING.txt.

Docker / deploy layer in this repository
  Dockerfile, scripts, Apache/PHP config, compose, Terraform modules
  License: GNU GPL v3.0 or later

Source for a published image is this repository at the matching git tag
(v<DOCKER_TAG>) plus the Moodle tarball named in versions.lock.

